      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Omit:\n•\nyou satisfy the general eligibility criteria: see subsection\n21(2); or\nsubstitute:\n•\nyou satisfy the general eligibility criteria and have\nsuccessfully completed a citizenship test: see subsections\n21(2) and (2A); or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Omit:\n•\nyou satisfy the general eligibility criteria: see subsection\n21(2); or\nsubstitute:\n•\nyou satisfy the general eligibility criteria and have\nsuccessfully completed a citizenship test: see subsections\n21(2) and (2A); or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
