          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007-sch-1-sec-23a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31a055f901f65d3cb8194eb898d83298aa113b67e923f1d1a6bf53397030b2d3",
      "skos:note": "Eligibility criteria for sitting the test must satisfy subsection 21(2)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-testing-act-2007#sch-1-sec-23a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23A(3) Citizenship test",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A determination under subsection (1) may set out the eligibility\ncriteria a person must satisfy to be able to sit the test.\nNote:\nThe eligibility criteria for sitting the test cannot be inconsistent with\nthis Act and in particular subsection 21(2) (about the general\neligibility criteria for becoming an Australian citizen)."
    },
