      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), the determination may provide\nthat a person is not eligible to sit the test unless the person is a\npermanent resident and the Minister is satisfied of the identity of\nthe person."
