      "cml:premiseText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), the determination may provide that a person is not eligible to sit the test unless the person is a permanent resident and the Minister is satisfied of the identity of the person.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person has been a permanent resident for at least some period"
    },
