      "cml:premiseText": "(2) An authorisation in force under subsection 40(3) or (4) of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 immediately before the commencement of this item has effect after that commencement as if it were an authorisation made under that subsection immediately after that commencement.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the request has effect after that commencement as if it were a request made under that subsection after that commencement."
